  "bodyHash": "335a333d155a5901",
  "content": "\n\n<h1>&nbsp;</h1>\n<p>这个模组为我们著名的游戏《逃离后室》（Escape the Backrooms）添加了更多生物！总共有 <strong>12 种生物类型</strong>&nbsp; ，包括：<br><strong>嚎叫者（Howler）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_e690256e-f5fc-437c-a5cd-b5b642f813f2.jpg\"><br><strong>剥皮者（Skin Skiler）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_fbb2aa14-c86e-4a90-b5cc-830856b0d01c.jpg\"><br><strong>微笑者（Smiler，含蜘蛛与雾形态）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_a8d877d0-368d-47af-afb3-f63651c823ad.jpg\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_1ee75f93-6894-49fc-a784-db2cee917217.jpg\"><br><strong>猎犬（Hound）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_79dba037-e137-44e9-9bd5-0b4b34d3602e.jpg\"><br><strong>派对客（Partygoer，含站立、行走与缓慢移动形态）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_93f5dff7-fcc7-457f-a95a-ab52f532c34a.jpg\"><br><strong>抓挠者（Scratcher，含新旧模型）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_c2778344-769a-449a-81f7-67bae3c1727a.jpg\"><br><strong>动画效果</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_a0dfae84-14ae-472d-8ca6-5cb4e24cd0d0.jpg\"><br><strong>第7层生物</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_ecdc9e32-e478-4e43-a3be-197a91d44eb1.jpg\"><br><strong>骨剥者（Bone Skiler）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1412935/description_d551121a-7b65-4441-9557-9c892b620d00.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"591\" height=\"303\"><br><strong>团块（Clump）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_57af98c3-0b8d-4828-a1be-08a6bac681dd.png\"><br><strong>肢体蛛（Aranea Membri）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_b4e43d1c-d2a6-4164-959c-cb4cf7ba9c45.jpg\"><br><strong>小猫（Kitty）</strong></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_2b88f01f-34a6-488f-bbf0-ee9dc1376196.jpg\"></p>\n<p><strong>藤蔓</strong></p>\n<p>此外还有方块和物品，例如：</p>\n<p>可作弊通过层级门</p>\n<p>躯体<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_cb75a093-0105-4acf-b2fe-ba64a54fe26f.png\"></p>\n<p>刀</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_d8f963ad-59c8-400c-a272-8bc8b8f1b3bf.png\"></p>\n<p>玩具<br><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_62a75bd7-3957-4c37-add3-d68cc05c16b1.png\"></p>\n<p>随着新“原声带层级”（Soundtrack Levels）的发布，本地图中已添加电脑等示例及其他功能。我已提前说明，Java版与基岩版（PE）的模组内容会有所不同。尽情体验我的模组带来的所有可能性吧！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1415153/description_1050aa74-3945-4b5a-8e07-3d00d4f40479.png\"></p>",
